{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1PE","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"彼得前书","commonName":"彼得前书","title":"彼得前书","order":60,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"7dd06bf3640798c48402d95c7029fea9dd3ca3d652c59417d5c51123ee5227fe","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1PE/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1PE/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["照管 神的羊群"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我这作长老、作基督受苦的见证、同享后来所要显现之荣耀的，劝你们中间与我同作长老的人："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["务要牧养在你们中间 神的群羊，按着 神旨意照管他们；不是出于勉强，乃是出于甘心；也不是因为贪财，乃是出于乐意；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["也不是辖制所托付你们的，乃是作群羊的榜样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["到了牧长显现的时候，你们必得那永不衰残的荣耀冠冕。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你们年幼的，也要顺服年长的。就是你们众人也都要以谦卑束腰，彼此顺服；因为",{"text":"神阻挡骄傲的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐恩给谦卑的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["所以，你们要自卑，服在 神大能的手下，到了时候，他必叫你们升高。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们要将一切的忧虑卸给 神，因为他顾念你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["务要谨守，警醒。因为你们的仇敌魔鬼，如同吼叫的狮子，遍地游行，寻找可吞吃的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["你们要用坚固的信心抵挡他，因为知道你们在世上的众弟兄也是经历这样的苦难。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那赐诸般恩典的 神曾在基督里召你们，得享他永远的荣耀，等你们暂受苦难之后，必要亲自成全你们，坚固你们，赐力量给你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["愿权能归给他，直到永永远远。阿们！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["问安"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我略略地写了这信，托我所看为忠心的兄弟西拉转交你们，劝勉你们，又证明这恩是 神的真恩。你们务要在这恩上站立得住。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["在巴比伦与你们同蒙拣选的教会问你们安。我儿子马可也问你们安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你们要用爱心彼此亲嘴问安。愿平安归与你们凡在基督里的人！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1PE/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2PE/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1PE/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}